http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:54.200 --> 00:59:56.920
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:57.860 --> 01:00:01.270
Pinatay mo ba talaga ang kuya mo?

01:00:01.270 --> 01:00:02.820
Binabati kita, Kamahalan

01:00:02.820 --> 01:00:06.150
Upang isagawa ang paghihimagsik ni Wang Gu,
kailangan nating mahuli si Eun

01:00:06.150 --> 01:00:08.850
Wala ka bang asong magagamit mo?

01:00:08.560 --> 01:00:14.860
Baka bigla kang dumaan at hindi mo napapansin, nakalimutan mo na ba ako?

01:00:09.200 --> 01:00:09.900
Mahuli sila

01:00:09.900 --> 01:00:11.340
hindi ko gagawin

01:00:11.340 --> 01:00:13.640
dapat

01:00:14.860 --> 01:00:21.860
Pero hanggang sa maalala mo ako, maghihintay ako sayo

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:18.590
Itinago ng court lady na si Hae Soo si Eun at ang kanyang asawa sa Damiwon

01:00:18.590 --> 01:00:21.280
Takbo! Pipigilan ko sila, at tumakbo ka!

01:00:21.910 --> 01:00:23.810
Pabayaan mo na kami!

01:00:22.160 --> 01:00:26.670
Sa parehong oras, sa parehong lugar tayo ay...

01:00:23.810 --> 01:00:25.030
Doc!
